lby-county"],["ARC or PLC in Shelby County","/arc-plc/illinois/shelby-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 through 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids landed at 28% of normal. Grid 22965 had its driest year in 1976 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
